sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant GRPC as gRPC server
    participant Store as TaskStore
    Client->>GRPC: CreateTask + user + stable Idempotency-Key (250ms deadline)
    GRPC->>Store: create(user, payload, key)
    Store-->>GRPC: task T1
    GRPC--xClient: reply lost / deadline expires
    Note over Client: retry only UNAVAILABLE or DEADLINE_EXCEEDED; backoff + jitter, max 3 attempts
    Client->>GRPC: CreateTask + SAME key and payload
    GRPC->>Store: lookup key, verify fingerprint
    Store-->>GRPC: existing T1
    GRPC-->>Client: T1 (no duplicate)
